  'This 4.5'' by 84'' mural was designed for a New York-style deli in Austin, Texas. The color scheme was chosen to match the rest of the decor in the restaurant, including tile and furniture. The graphic imagery and striking, but subtle palette, make the mural commanding, but not overpowering. The owners called us just a month before the restaurant''s opening date. Being accustomed to deadlines of this nature, we were able to design and complete the giant mural in just three and a half weeks.',
