) VALUES (
  'pulte-homes-murals',
  'Pulte Homes Murals',
  '2010',
  'mural',
  'Pulte Homes called us to redo their conference room in their local Austin headquarters. They wanted to add excitement and corporate identity to their decor without making it look "like a carnival". After a lengthy design process they decided on this look. The flag mural was designed to have employee award plaques added over time under the different categories. The 6'' tall by 9'' long Austin Postcard mural has photos of employees enjoying recreational activities mounted to the surface. These were designed to be easily replaced with new images over time. All of the work was done during the evenings and weekends to avoid interruption of the company''s routine.',
